      "audioUrl": "audio/yamato_match_start_yamato_haze_convo03_01.mp3",
      "text": "When do you try to arrest me?",
      "duration": 1.829
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "character": "Haze",
      "audioFile": "haze_match_start_yamato_haze_convo03_02",
      "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_yamato_haze_convo03_02.mp3",
      "text": "Right now your operation is small enough that the OSIC wouldn't waste allocating resources on you.",
      "duration": 6.537
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "character": "Yamato",
      "audioFile": "yamato_match_start_yamato_haze_convo03_03",
      "audioUrl": "audio/yamato_match_start_yamato_haze_convo03_03.mp3",
      "text": "And if the 7th Moon grows?",
      "duration": 1.873
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "character": "Haze",
      "audioFile": "haze_match_start_yamato_haze_convo03_04",
      "audioUrl": "audio/haze_match_start_yamato_haze_convo03_04.mp3",
      "text": "Well, if it gets big enough it stops being a gang and starts being a cartel.  That's usually when my superiors start thinking about having me kill you in your sleep.",
      "duration": 10.769
    }
  ]
}